71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lbZ0rwUjr_0Q7kNvwEUTh0Y&_nc_oc=AdpA6wnpVnnZT4R9t2AoUymPT4Dssxj0I_5xnyq80PiH95Gqq4pSst14KfIdlcYOXZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHjjiC6m8zjvo8U1a7nnGMq962GytTu717vIJaKbHgX6g&oe=6A733639"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZH4XX63iT9cQ7kNvwG3IGnZ&_nc_oc=AdobtlT29fe3JSJQQbHOmXCZioaSEQYFHIqeUzbcP54CBe2X23n6X82ph3KIZO3z6tk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFbrECZ_QocZlTv4zwj0P9zbMIU-Hi4VvPBc7KsGfC3mw&oe=6A734913"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NyUZ_sfJjh8Q7kNvwGQnrVM&_nc_oc=AdreQwu4poY2T4tKfGPN_0ukFci91TfZzl-m_wkHdwGkHktN36coIotAqcMHLCCAH10&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGfhXjo-5Fpb1UQjQJGE3FoFDU5g6ki_Kv7OEsztHiybg&oe=6A73475A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: